Subject: [PATCH] Orbify: orbify home cover heap floor

Fetch Home covers only when the heap has room beside the current session.

diff --git a/src/BookOrbitHomeStore.cpp b/src/BookOrbitHomeStore.cpp
index 2fbe13b..a2e8225 100644
--- a/src/BookOrbitHomeStore.cpp
+++ b/src/BookOrbitHomeStore.cpp
